Sirus Code uses a subset of the icons from the `@iconify-json/solar` package and Zeron's adjusted
copies of them (https://github.com/zeronsh/comet, MIT; see zeron.LICENSE). Changes: stroke widths
normalized to 1.7, coordinates rounded to two decimals, 16 px drawings scaled to the 24 px grid.
